    "title": "于学习《勇毅笃行 长风万里--习近平总书记引领中国经济发展稳中求进术评》的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2022-06-17",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">各位党员：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">　　<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">根椐流动党员支部学习计划，本周学习内容：《</span></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">勇毅笃行 长风万里--习近平总书记引领中国经济发展稳中求进术评</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">　　<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">学习形式：自学，各位党员要记好学习笔记。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>　　<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">特此通知。</span></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n                ",
